  "content": "[Intro]\nHe's the\n\n[Verse 1]\n[G7]mayor of Lonely Town,\npopulation: one\n[Am7]Population:\none\n[D7]Staring a hole in the ground,\nstaring at the sun\n[G7]Oh, [F]woah\n[E7]And I'm\n[Am7]starting to feel like\n[D7]he might be real Like he's\n[Bm]something I might become\n[E7]Running for\n[Am7]mayor of Lonely Town,\n[D7]population: one\n[G7]\n[D7]See the\n\n[Verse 2]\n[G7]mayor of Lonely Town\nstanding in the square\n[Am7]At the county fair\n[D7]Shouting his message\nout, but there's no one\n[G7]there [F]Oh, there\n[E7]And the\n[Am7]silence surrounds but he's\n[D7]lost in the sound Of their\n[Bm]army of fifes and drums\n[E7]Marching for\n[Am7]mayor of Lonely Town,\n[D7]population: one\n[G7]\n[D7]Sha, bada, bada, bada, bada If\n\n[Bridge]\n[G7]you want to go to Lone-\n[A7]ly Town\n[C]Just pay the fare\n[G7]Ba ba da, da ba da, da ba da Un-\nless you're with me, then you'll\n[A7]get in for free, 'cause, baby\nI [D7]know the ma-\n[G7]yor Da da doh [B7]\n\n[Interlude]\n[Em]No one seems [D#aug]to want\n[G/D]to be [G(b5)/Db]near;\n[Cm6]they all run away\n[G][B7]But\n[Em]deep inside, [D#aug]a song\n[G/D]you can [G(b5)/Db]hear,\n[Am7]calling out your name\n[D7][D#dim/C][D7/B][D7/A]Well the\n\n[Verse 3]\n[G7]mayor of Lonely Town,\ntucking into bed Ohoh\n[Am7]What's inside his head?\n[D7]Visions of sugarplums\nand loneliness\n[G7]Oh, [F]yes\n[E7]Now we've\n[Am7]all got to be what\n[D7]we want to be But that\n[Bm]does not seem quite so fun\n[E7]To be the\n[Am7]mayor of Lonely Town,\n[D7]population Star-\n[Am7]ing a hole in the ground,\n[D7]population Ma-\n[Am7]yor of Lonely Town,\n[D7]population: One\n\n[Outro]\n[Em]  [D#aug]\n[G/D]  [G(b5)/Db]\n[Cm6]Ah, ah, ah, ah, [Dsus4]ah, [Am7]ah, [G]ah",
